--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
This library implements the GstNvIpcMeta GstMeta type used to carry object
rectangle parameters across an inter-process pipeline. It provides the
serialization and deserialization helpers that let the producer process pack the
metadata alongside the shared buffer and the consumer process attach it back to
the received GstBuffer.
Refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for more details.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pre-requisites:
- GStreamer-1.0 Development package
- GStreamer-1.0 Base Plugins Development package

Install using:
   sudo apt-get install libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-dev libgstreamer1.0-dev

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ sudo make (sudo not required in case of docker containers)
  $ sudo make install (sudo not required in case of docker containers)

The library libnvdsgst_ipcmeta.so is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
How to test:
Refer to the sample application sources/apps/sample_apps/deepstream-ipc-test for
a reference usage of this metadata.
